From: zbai29 <zbai29@wisc.edu>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Launch bare 1M Claude catalog ids with [1m] on a gateway

Claude Code budgets a bare catalog id at 200k when ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL is not
the official API. Append [1m] only for a gateway, and only when that bare id
already has a 1M window and is not its own distinct [1m] catalog row.

Rebased onto getpaseo/paseo v0.11.4 (dc5b02f7d). Includes Haiku 5.5.

---
